# MH context rule

Read `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` before planning or editing this project.

Use `BILLING_SETUP.md` for Stripe and EU-payment work and `README.md` for local operation and SEO.

Keep `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` current when a change affects product behavior, pricing, architecture, deployment status, security, billing, or the next-step list.

Never claim that Stripe is live, that external AI generates content, or that campaigns publish automatically unless the implementation and configuration have been verified.
